  "body": "@agriggio I'm not sure if it is an issue, just a question of why on a choice. The question is specifically for the sidecar generated when, for example, converting an image with the cli:\n\n`ART-cli -Y -t -s -O image.tif -c image.cr3`\n\nThe image converted will use the default camera parameters for temperature and tint but the ones written to the sidecar generated, even if ignored, are the default 6504K for temperature and 1 for tint. Is there a reason for this? or why not write the values that were computed from the camera.\n\nThanks a lot 🙌 ",
